    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "winter_Tue4",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Hi @.#$e#Is anything exciting happening on your farm?",
      "translation": "Ahoj, @.#$e#Děje se na tvé farmě něco zajímavého?",
      "sourceSHA256": "f808a1f88c56638b36430dece6adfd8a0ce3bdaf64121f848b18f7da2c92a87b",
      "translationSHA256": "855417e71f7465ab1fb5d0cf5de0c585e11ca129d96b670736141f0cf94e4772",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "winter_Wed6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "I think I'm starting to realize that clothes aren't the most important thing. Right?#$e#I still like clothes, though. I mean, what's wrong with expressing yourself a little?",
      "translation": "Asi si začínám uvědomovat, že oblečení není to nejdůležitější. Ne?#$e#Pořád ho ale mám ráda. Chci říct, co je špatného na tom trochu projevit svou osobnost?",
      "sourceSHA256": "209664530d06e70eb04450c661daea1b3a43660cf2586015ade515ab846a0c36",
      "translationSHA256": "1bfc8dc1c6fc677798cb2358f05d4fc97af4ef03ddc41831f2dcdd927617456c",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "winter_Thu6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Maybe I'll donate some of my skirts to a charity this spring.#$e#I mean, I do have over 1,000 skirts.$h#$e#...what?",
      "translation": "Možná na jaře daruji nějaké sukně charitě.#$e#Vždyť jich mám přes tisíc.$h#$e#...Co je?",
      "sourceSHA256": "0bba91f7d3a879e7faff7d9a89bd3732b6acf3a15be5522fbe57bc6c080cc72b",
      "translationSHA256": "e279dd7e387b164ef4e92c5e91675ee0285499a3364905c8c8c4cea45c9b32d3",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
        "detailsAndTone",
        "glossary",
        "czechGrammar",
        "englishResidue",
        "characterVoice",
        "context",
        "tokensAndStructure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "target": "Characters/Dialogue/Haley",
      "key": "winter_Sun6",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Um, if you see Alex could you tell him I'm busy today?#$e#Thanks.",
      "translation": "Ehm, jestli uvidíš Alexe, řekneš mu, že mám dneska moc práce?#$e#Díky.",
      "sourceSHA256": "58d9b85d0ee5875941baa0408470540c4c3de3cc81ca6de428f1d11a0f6efc5c",
      "translationSHA256": "3aca3e7fcd8609ed659fbe7bf06f19402f454a11ccb701ef0d7edf3e15f54dc7",
      "reviewChecks": [
        "sourceMeaning",
